pbwinput 1
# A smoke test of Frigate's test launcher on the port alone (ctest launch_summary_standalone): the continue sequence's
# presses take the starter save's CONTINUE to where the game asks for the field, the launcher opens Tepig's summary
# as the game does without the party list (--launch summary, the standalone path of event_field_proclink.c's
# func_ov012_0215bb70), and B closes it. On game frames. White 2: Black 2's presses, from White 2's own starter save.
version w2_us
# START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1100 START
1101 -
# START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3000 START
3001 -
# START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3249
3100 START
3101 -
# CONTINUE
3400 A
3401 -
# B closes the summary, which the launcher opened at once
3700 B
3706 -
